# The ten new PRIM kinds in the Showcase Shapes room, from above the south of the north half: roof
# wedge, pyramid, spire, buttresses, eight-sided pillars and bevelled blocks behind; the spiral
# stair, the culvert, the curved wall and the catwalk in front. Tube: culling.
world custom "custom maps/Starter Map.rmc"
map-name Starter Map / Showcase Shapes
camera 13.4 18.8 4.7 -80 -80
scenery-only
size 1600 900
frames 12
step 0
culling-shot new-shapes-east
